Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: Device adaptation configs for Xiaomi Mi 6 (sagit)
 This package contains device-specific configurations for Xiaomi Mi 6,
 including screen scaling for Phosh (5.15" 1080P), Qualcomm MSM8998
 hardware device node permissions, and default hostname.
